flowchart TB
    N1["1. neo-vm-rs: Proof/evidence flow shows how a claim becomes checkable."]
    N2["2. Claim: This unit performed: Decode canonical opcodes | Execute stack and state semantics | Expose reusable runtime APIs."]
    N3["3. Witness or input: NeoVM bytecode | initial stack | syscall host callbacks"]
    N4["4. Execution or check: execute under NeoVM semantics and check stack, gas, syscalls, and fault state"]
    N5["5. Public commitment: script hash, final stack digest, halt/fault status, and gas"]
    N6["6. Verifier: neo-riscv-vm | neo-zkvm | Neo N4 execution core"]
    N7["7. Accepted result: halt/fault result | final stack | gas/accounting evidence"]
    N8["8. Rejected result: enter fault or reject; unverifiable side effects are not committed"]
    N1 --> N2
    N2 --> N3
    N3 --> N4
    N4 --> N5
    N5 --> N6
    N6 --> N7
    N7 --> N8
    classDef core fill:#0f172a,stroke:#38bdf8,color:#e5f2ff,stroke-width:2px;
    classDef support fill:#111827,stroke:#64748b,color:#f8fafc;
    class N1 core;
    class N2,N3,N4,N5,N6,N7,N8 support;
